+**Goal:** Embed the direct STO runtime inside STO Linux Command and apply authoritative visual-stability settings before every direct launch.
+
+**Architecture:** A pure Rust visual-stability module prepares display/profile/GamePrefs/DXVK state and wraps the existing direct UMU LaunchPlan in nested Gamescope. A GUI-only X11/XWayland containment controller uses xdotool to reparent and resize the Gamescope window into the launcher viewport. Local Arc installer import remains separate from PLAY.
